      "cooked": "<p>GL impact is not posting upon submission of the Journal Entry. When a user submits the journal entry, the default behaviour is posting the ledger entry, and we can check the ledger impact by clicking on the button View Ledger, but in some cases, we are facing an issue where it’s not posting GL impact, and nothing shows in the ledger for that entry. Not sure why<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/7/4721e24b44fcaf0fad13e01f1451092dd63681d9.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/4721e24b44fcaf0fad13e01f1451092dd63681d9\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/7/4721e24b44fcaf0fad13e01f1451092dd63681d9_2_690x280.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"a9guMmMCUhJF7Eb5BAnT0cLayQp\" width=\"690\" height=\"280\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/7/4721e24b44fcaf0fad13e01f1451092dd63681d9_2_690x280.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/7/4721e24b44fcaf0fad13e01f1451092dd63681d9_2_1035x420.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/7/4721e24b44fcaf0fad13e01f1451092dd63681d9_2_1380x560.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1422×578 60.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/c/ec56e5f1e1ce615b0bedead4e0e20a2124aa0c8f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ec56e5f1e1ce615b0bedead4e0e20a2124aa0c8f\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/opti